<title>USA: Norwood Q4 shr with charge is $0.03.</title>
<headline>Norwood Q4 shr with charge is $0.03.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Texas 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norwood Promotional Products Inc said Tuesday that its $0.20 per share results for the fourth quarter ending August 31 exclude an after-tax charge of $983,000, or $0.19 per share.</p>
<p>Including the charge, fourth quarter earnings were $185,000 or $0.03 per share, and fiscal 1996 earnings were $4.15 million, or $0.82 per share, the company said.</p>
<p>The company said the charge was related to a restructuring of its sales and marketing functions and to other organizational changes.</p>
</text>
